' ---------------- 23 enforced foreign keys ----------------
SUPP  ||--o{ INGR
MENU  ||--o{ RECIPE
INGR  ||--o{ RECIPE
USERS ||--o{ ORD
CUST  ||--o{ ORD
ORD   ||--o{ ODET
MENU  ||--o{ ODET
RTAB  ||--o{ RESV
INGR  ||--o{ LEDG
USERS ||--o{ LEDG
SUPP  ||--o{ PO
USERS ||--o{ PO
PO    ||--o{ POI
INGR  ||--o{ POI
SUPP  ||--o{ GRN
USERS ||--o{ GRN
PO    ||--o{ GRN
GRN   ||--o{ GRNI
INGR  ||--o{ GRNI
USERS ||--o{ SHIFT
USERS ||--o{ SHIFT
USERS ||--o{ WASTE
INGR  ||--o{ WASTE

' ---------------- logical references carried in code, not by a constraint ----
RTAB  ..o{ ORD : "table_id (no FK)"
USERS ..o{ AUDIT : "user_id (no FK)"
CUST  ..   PROMO
ORD   ..   SETT

legend bottom
  <b>FK rules</b>  CASC = CASCADE   RSTR = RESTRICT   SETNULL = SET NULL
  <b>Types</b>  BIG = BIGINT   VC = VARCHAR   DEC = DECIMAL   DT = DATETIME   BOOL = BOOLEAN
  Keys and defining columns only — every column, type and nullability is listed in Appendix A.4, Data Dictionary.
  <b>ENUM domains</b>
  <b>[1]</b> users.role — ADMIN, MANAGER, WAITER, KITCHEN, CASHIER
  <b>[2]</b> ingredients.unit_type — KG, LITER, UNITS
  <b>[3]</b> restaurant_tables.operational_status — AVAILABLE, OCCUPIED, BILLED, CLEANING, RESERVED
  <b>[4]</b> orders.status / order_details.line_status — PENDING, PREPARING, READY, BILLED, COMPLETED, VOID
  <b>[5]</b> inventory_ledger.reason — RECIPE_DEDUCTION, GRN_RECEIPT, MANUAL_ADJUSTMENT, WASTE_SPOILAGE, STOCK_TAKE_CORRECTION
  <b>[6]</b> purchase_orders.status — DRAFT, PENDING_APPROVAL, APPROVED, ORDERED, RECEIVED, CANCELLED
endlegend

note bottom of SETT
  ORDERS.table_id and RESTAURANT_TABLES.current_order_id
  are intentionally left without FK constraints: an enforced
  pair would be circular. Referential integrity for both is
  held in TableService inside the order transaction.
  PROMOTIONS and SYSTEM_SETTINGS carry no foreign keys. Both join
  by value: promotions.required_loyalty_tier is matched against
  customers.loyalty_tier when a discount is priced, and
  system_settings supplies SERVICE_CHARGE_RATE and VAT_RATE to
  every order that is billed.
end note

@enduml
